                        "language": "english",
                        "review": "The tutorial only teaches you camera controls. The gameplay is in the game's description. So, you need to arrange 5 scenes in the correct order to piece together the story from start to finish.\n\nScenes are ordered randomly. Not sure if this is their purpose, but it isn't that difficult to arrange the scenes. Each story is just 5 scenes and the game shows you which scenes you got right and wrong, then auto-restarts. It took me under 30 minutes to complete all stories.\n\nUnfortunately, there's just 9 stories and 3 bonus stories. So it's a pretty short game.",
